                    <h1 class="text-[30px] md:text-[44px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.98] max-w-[720px]">No Credit Check Loans That <span class="text-emerald-500">Build Credit</span> vs Predatory Payday Loans: 2026 Guide</h1>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-[16px] text-slate-500 leading-7 max-w-[680px]">Not all no-credit-check loans are scams — but most payday loans are traps. Here’s how to spot the credit-builders like Self, MoneyLion, and Possible that report to all 3 bureaus vs 300%+ APR debt cycles the CFPB warns about.</p>

